formation quickly and effectively—no unnecessary details! I'll organize this in a way that's easy to digest. Let's get to the skills!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I currently have these specialized skills available:\n\n- healthcheck — security hardening, exposure review, OpenClaw host checks\n- skill-creator — create, improve, audit, or clean up AgentSkills\n- weather — current weather and forecasts\n- kidney-pipeline-execution — run the kidney CT pipeline on an uploaded scan\n- llm-distillator — turn health/tool output into a patient-friendly explanation\n- nephrology-klm — kidney/nephrology domain guidance\n- patient-klm — retrieve or update patient knowledge-base records\n- pipeline-generator — generate an ML pipeline prototype from a prompt\n\nIf you want, I can also tell you when I’d use each one, or just use one directly for your task.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06bf359e6b9b3eb10169c91f4681588191bdd93e5442ede4c2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":358,"output":177,"cacheRead":8448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8983,"cost":{"input":0.0008950000000000001,"output":0.0026550000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0021119999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005662}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774788419537}}
